                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \exp\big( 2 \pi i \frac{j}{\left\vert g \right\vert}  \big)
          %p#RotationConditionImpliedByHuanInertiaEquivariance
            This rotation condition may be understood more intrinsically (this is made explicit on
            %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1912.02374.pdf#page=69"} p. 63
            of
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#Dove19"} Dove 19
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifold+K-theory"} orbifold K-theory
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Huan%27s+inertia+orbifold"} Huan's inertia orbifold
            (
            %a{:href => "#Huan18"}> Huan 18
            ), induced by the nature of the quotient groups
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi Λ
                    %mi g
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mo ≔
                  %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                  %mfrac
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi C
                        %mi g
                      %mo ×
                      %mi ℝ
                    %mrow
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ⟨
