                %em Quasi-theories and their equivariant orthogonal spectra
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07622"}> arXiv:1809.07622
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and some general abstract clarification on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Huan%27s+inertia+orbifold"} Huan's inertia orbifold
            in:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Cyclification+of+Orbifolds"} Cyclification of Orbifolds
