                %a{:href => "https://zoom.us/rec/play/_2MIenxSff2vBZeFPO8lV6g_lyLgrUEBDP5Au7tySNyeJpeLeXfZ96ZBkgKs7wNYAnBDauB4atzVJAt-.McANEtFgQHFACmbr?_x_zm_rhtaid=966&_x_zm_rtaid=F4VKJYOLRDu8ouQdfmDz3w.1668757869896.554b5189e89fa9af0846d97599b6bf49&autoplay=true&continueMode=true&iet=6_ddkV5u8UGa9M9U4dDvH2SN55OyZgmZiCrQZ6wbo4E.AG.Gp56JL6y5Z3naAtSVPOGAHkLGEPMDtxPB370GxyQz_EIJOEq1ylk0bXAowqSDnPSYr62xiX92tLdNLdbchq-w5Vhavx5UCPbjfaCIIObE183OI8.142oNpQmC8JiJOzcA4eIXw.O0nEkHAMvD5awvgi&startTime=1667999236000"}> video
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On quasi-elliptic cohomology of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representation+spheres"} representation spheres
            as an approximation to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+Cohomotopy"} equivariant Cohomotopy
